// Suspicious Explorer Process with Whitespace Padding - ClickFix/FileFix | T1027.010, T1204.004 | https://github.com/SigmaHQ/sigma/blob/master/rules/windows/process_creation/proc_creation_win_susp_clickfix_filefix_whitespace_padding.yml
(ParentImage:*\\explorer.exe AND CommandLine:*#*) AND (CommandLine:(*            * OR *            * OR *            * OR *            * OR *            * OR *            * OR *            * OR *            * OR *            * OR *            * OR *            * OR *            * OR *\ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ *))

